\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fi-180\li180\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. Up arise, all ye believers,\cf0 
\par \pard\li180\sl190\slmult0\qj Prepare to battle the deceiver!
\par This enemy seeks your defeat!
\par With the word of God be girded,
\par Ignore how satan's threats are worded;
\par \pard\li180\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par \pard\li180\sl190\slmult0\qj The valiant never need retreat!
\par Of satan have no fear,
\par Immanuel is here.
\par Glad hosanna! Tho' Satan fight
\par Christ has the might
\par And we shall gain the realm of light.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li360\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2.  Conquer ev'ry evil passion,
\par \pard\li360\sl190\slmult0\qj Let Christ you to His image fashion,
\par Renew your power in the Lord.
\par In His name be strong but humble,
\par \pard\li360\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par \pard\li360\sl190\slmult0\qj Not as the lame who well might stumble.
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0\qj\cf1 God's help is near, stay in accord.\cf0 
\par When burdens grieve the soul,
\par Look upwards to the goal,
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0\qj There is gladness! Come then,
\par Unite prepare to fight
\par And wear a crown, the victor's right!
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. Strive that in the years remaining,
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0\qj You may depart your goal attaining;
\par For soon the earthly body dies!
\par When His own the Lord shall waken
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0\qj And Christ's return the World has shaken,
\par We then shall as the firstlings rise!
\par Praise God we're reconciled,
\par Tho' by the world reviled.
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0\qj Short the suff'ring! God's son we know,
\par Planned long ago
\par The crown of honour to bestow.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\qj\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. Jesus give Thy children power,
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0\qj Thy strength to conquer in us shower,
\par For we've been purchased by the blood!
\par Quicken us with Thine own Spirit,
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0\qj Uplift us, to Thee thro' Thy merit,
\par Let courage fill us like a flood!
\par Thy spirit be our guide;
\par Let Him in us abide,
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0\qj Our hearts filling,
\par So shall we be kept safe in Thee
\par \pard    On earth and in eternity.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2\fs14 
\par }

